Comment: 0,0:00:00.24,0:00:00.24,Comment,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.31,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}プレ！　プレパラート！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:27.31,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}強くなんかないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:30.44,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}プレ！　プレパレード！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.44,0:02:33.11,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}いつか君を捕まえる！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:51.12,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}油断したら　その指　チクチクアタック　覚悟して
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:57.09,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}小さいけど　挟むの　ミジンコみたいなアナタ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:03:01.51,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}欲しいのは　プラスチックなハート
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:03.51,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fs-2\fad(150,150)\pos(640,670)}プラス　プラス　ダケドマイナス
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:10.89,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}でもそれじゃつまらない　そこに気付いた者勝ち
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.69,0:03:16.61,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H439AF4&}恋は甘くて　苦いもの
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.61,0:03:19.61,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H4FBBD3&}単純明快　複雑怪奇な代物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:22.57,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}どうでもいい事ばっかり気にしたりするの
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:25.62,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}どんな感じ？ソンな感じ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:28.62,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}温厚篤実　エキセントリックなアナタ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.74,0:03:31.62,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}強がる素振りを全身まとって太刀打ち
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:34.63,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}素直なだけだと刺激が強くて　クラクラ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:40.05,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}傷ついちゃうの　傷つけちゃうの　純情プレパラート
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:46.01,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H5E47F0&}頭の中は　いつも一人の　純情プレパレード
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.31,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Pre!  Praparat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:27.31,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}我完全就不堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:30.44,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Pre!  Pre-Parade!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.44,0:02:33.11,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}我終究會把你攬入懷裡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:51.12,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}敢大意的話就做好覺悟  你的手指就會受到刺針般的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:57.09,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}雖然你像水蚤一樣小隻  不過還是能夾起來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:03:01.51,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}想要的  是那顆塑膠內心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:03.51,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fs-2\fad(150,150)\pos(640,55)}Plus Plus  卻還是Minus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:10.89,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}只是那樣是百般無聊  發現這點的就是贏家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.69,0:03:16.61,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H439AF4&}戀愛是甜蜜中夾帶苦澀的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.61,0:03:19.61,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H4FBBD3&}是單純明快且複雜奇怪的玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:22.57,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}總會在意些無關重要的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:25.62,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}是什麼感覺？就是這種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:28.62,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}溫厚老實且稀奇古怪的你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.74,0:03:31.62,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}硬要逞強不斷全力揮棒與我較量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:34.63,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}你說自己很坦率  這個太過刺激讓你頭暈眼花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:40.05,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}快要受傷了  快要傷害你了  純情的Praparat
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:46.01,OPCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)\3c&H5E47F0&}腦海中一直只有一個人  純情的Pre-Parade
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:59.65,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}バニラソルトで Burning Love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.86,0:22:07.24,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}アマいだけなら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.53,0:22:12.29,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ソルトかけましょう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.42,0:22:18.96,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}誰よりももっともっと私を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:22.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}知って欲しいからさらけだしたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.55,0:22:25.84,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}でも出来ないの　経験Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.84,0:22:27.51,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}モドカシすぎる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.60,0:22:34.52,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}でも、アマいだけの愛はちょっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:42.23,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}私が求めているモノとは違う
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:45.95,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}シロと言われたら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.24,0:22:49.37,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}クロだって言っちゃう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.57,0:22:52.74,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}素直になれない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.16,0:22:55.12,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}アマノジャク
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.46,0:22:59.67,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}スキと言われたら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.00,0:23:03.09,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ダイキライだって
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.34,0:23:08.93,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}嬉しいのにナニ言ってんだろう?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.43,0:23:15.93,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}アマいバニラに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.10,0:23:20.94,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}ソルトかけるよに…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:59.65,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}香草加點鹽  讓愛火燃燒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.86,0:22:07.24,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}如果只有甜味太過單調的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.53,0:22:12.29,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}就加一點鹽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.42,0:22:18.96,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}想讓你比起別人都能更加了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:22.55,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}所以想把自己的一切全盤展示出來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.55,0:22:25.84,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}但是我做不到  因為經驗是零
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.84,0:22:27.51,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}讓人看著心急
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.60,0:22:34.52,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}但是  甜蜜的愛情只有一點點
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:42.23,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}跟我追求的東西不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:45.95,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}如果你說是白色
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.24,0:22:49.37,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我就會說是黑色
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.57,0:22:52.74,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}無法變得坦率起來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.16,0:22:55.12,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}最喜歡鬧彆扭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.46,0:22:59.67,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}你說喜歡我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.00,0:23:03.09,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我就會回覆最討厭你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.34,0:23:08.93,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}明明內心很高興  我怎麼會說那些話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.43,0:23:15.93,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}在甜甜的香草上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.10,0:23:20.94,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}撒一點鹽吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:55.67,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(378,462)\pos(968,485)}你的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:34.97,Title,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H5C5C5C&\pos(860,523)}那時候的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.35,0:00:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睏…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.63,0:00:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,話說  你沒把裙子裡的紙巾拿出來直接丟進洗衣桶裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.63,0:00:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,害死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.63,0:00:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,還有彩色的衣服要分開放
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,深顏色的要放在橘色的洗衣桶…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了  吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你太吹毛求疵了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.57,0:00:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,男人就別管雞毛蒜皮…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.21,0:00:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,看我來一個猛擊  Yeah Yeah Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.79,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,看我來一個猛擊  Yeah Yeah Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,來一個猛擊  Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,來一個猛擊  Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,看我來一個猛擊  Yeah Yeah Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.76,0:00:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,別在意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.69,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:00:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就輪到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.29,0:01:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,隊長  加油
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.94,0:01:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,感謝大家的聲援
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.59,0:01:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.35,0:01:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好  儘管放馬過來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那副清爽的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.70,0:01:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.30,0:01:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.77,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你那閃閃發亮的汗滴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,一壘了  Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.65,0:01:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,二壘了  Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.57,0:01:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,跑完三壘  就是全壘打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,還有那個不對調的歌唱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.79,0:01:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,回本壘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你今早也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.82,0:01:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,噁心狗  你的視線太淫蕩了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝  關於週末男女共同練習的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,北村  我也正好想…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.23,0:02:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,笨狗  知道了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.45,0:02:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  叫你住手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.61,Comment,,0,0,0,,等等  站住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.88,0:02:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,即使是回家社的人  今天也充分奔跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.21,0:02:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,健康第一呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:04:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,手機美容師嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.47,0:04:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨真手巧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,還好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,別看我這樣  其實很手巧的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.71,0:04:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,她在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.70,0:04:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  完成一個了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.45,0:04:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好  接下來是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.13,0:04:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼發出像是被人絞殺一樣的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.37,0:04:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要不也幫高須做一個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我在做手機美容師的兼職
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,美容師?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我用紫色的珠子  幫你拼龍兒兩個字吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.75,0:04:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝為了我?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.35,0:04:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我就…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我們的也拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,訂單來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.99,0:05:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在這份列表裡寫下你們的名字和想要的顏色和形象
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我要粉紅色
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,一顆大大的心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.45,0:05:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,給人一種很可愛的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:09.99,Comment,,0,0,0,,那真是很可愛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,她在兼職做手機美容師啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.53,0:05:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,閃閃發亮的櫛枝加上閃閃發亮的美容過的手機
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.10,0:05:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,令人驚異的合適組合
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.16,0:05:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,小泰今晚要陪客戶吃飯  不在家吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼她的菜就讓我吃…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,而且還說龍兒…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,她還記住我叫什麼名字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.09,0:05:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我一直這樣叫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.03,0:05:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,話說回來  小泰的菜…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,今天跟她說了很多話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,大河  我說話的時候有奇怪的地方…嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你倒是聽別人說話啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我順便告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,非常奇怪!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.42,0:05:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,然後  晚飯好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,痛死了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的  快好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是吃蓋澆飯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,飯煮好了就能馬上…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.63,0:06:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.04,0:06:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,電子鍋壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.44,0:06:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨  晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.90,0:06:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要吃什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,居然特地跑來家庭餐廳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.66,0:06:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然沒有飯  但是有麵包啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.14,0:06:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,劣等狗  你就趁現在多叫幾聲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.83,0:06:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你很快就會為了感激我而下跪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.98,0:06:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,兩份  送來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我們還沒點東西…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.18,0:06:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,別說出去  這是大河特別版聖代特大號
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,吃的時候別讓其他客人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.61,0:06:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨  一直以來謝謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,一直以來?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,高須不喜歡吃甜食嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.51,0:06:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那就換成炸薯條吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,給你裝很多  裝非常多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我就…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨還在便利店和卡拉OK包廂打工吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.41,0:07:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯  上週還增加了刷刷鍋的兼職
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼多!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,即使這樣  我還有餘裕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,作為女子壘球社的社長  社團活動怎麼也不能請假吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你這麼努力是有想要的東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.71,0:07:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我有多餘的時間  所以就需要勤勞過日
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.56,0:07:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,勤勞…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯  就是勤勞怪異事件簿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:32.31,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs35}注 : 這裡出自電視劇「銀狼怪奇事件簿」勤勞和銀狼讀音部分相同
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,這是覺醒的勤勞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.22,0:07:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不過話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你們的關係真好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.40,0:07:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,服務員  我要平碗菜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.31,0:07:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我先忙  你們慢慢吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.59,0:08:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,就今天  我的視力肯定有所下降
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,區區一條劣等狗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.05,0:08:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,居然看著實乃梨的餐廳制服流口水
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.97,0:08:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,覺得她「她的笑容閃閃發亮啊」什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.53,0:08:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,大人請放過小人的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,算了  會弄髒我的手指
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但是為什麼她會做那麼多兼職
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她不是說勤勞怪異事件簿嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.65,0:08:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,難道她有什麼急需要錢的原因嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.14,0:08:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,像家裡的情況什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,或需要籌錢去救生病的母親
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不是說勤勞嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.57,0:08:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你這種自以為是  還是放棄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.04,0:09:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,像「只有我才能理解真正的她」這種
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,會更彰顯你的噁心度
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.86,0:09:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,真討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.49,0:09:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,走路時離我遠一點  太噁心了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.09,0:09:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大河你這是什麼口氣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,太冷淡了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,都叫你別靠近我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,再說  我一直都對你很冷淡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.48,0:09:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,說得也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.15,0:09:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好  小鸚讓你久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,這是晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,給你裝很多  裝非常多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.69,0:09:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,U…nko
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要說嗎  小鸚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.05,0:09:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,要說出名字了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.77,0:09:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,U…nk
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.15,0:09:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,U…大便
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:58.16,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fs30\b0\bord0\c&H554943&\frz347.9\pos(450,400)}我們去吃早餐\N冰箱有三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:10:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,假日的早晨  真是清爽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.67,0:10:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧  大河
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,果然不應該告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你說什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,為了見實乃梨  居然不做早餐跑去家庭餐廳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,電子鍋還壞著  沒辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.56,0:10:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那就應該去維修店啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,再說你不是說不喜歡吃麵包嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,早餐的話  吃麵包也無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.95,0:10:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你在興奮什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.83,0:10:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那件衣服不適合你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我忘記東西了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,真是麻煩的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了  放我走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,反正你穿什麼都一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,小哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.95,0:10:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是魅羅乃的兒子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.06,0:10:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,稻毛叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,魅羅乃?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是泰子的源氏名
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.31,0:10:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,她工作場所用的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.03,0:10:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,北邊街口轉彎  再往前走200米
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.50,0:11:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我是毘沙門天國的魅羅乃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我看起來像多少歲?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.11,0:11:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,23?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.71,0:11:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,猜對了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.65,0:11:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,今天一大早就有好兆頭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,觸摸魅羅乃的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.58,0:11:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,DNA!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,非常不錯  非常結實有彈性
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.23,0:11:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,年輕真好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我們走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,總覺得這個大叔讓人很火大
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.68,0:11:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  兩位客官
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.97,0:11:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,如果還沒有吃早餐的話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我推薦這個富含DHA和鈣的魚肉腸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.17,0:11:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.42,0:11:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,實乃梨?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.19,0:11:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,來吧  搬這個
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,接著
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,再來一箱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,還是由我來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不用  魅羅乃的兒子就喝點茶什麼的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.55,0:12:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼我一定要做這種事!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然僅限假日  我拜託她過來工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝  要好好幹活
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.12,0:12:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我們最近比較忙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,人手不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,人手…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.08,0:12:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,對了  小妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.63,0:12:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你是櫛枝的朋友  你也要來做兼職嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,薪水很豐厚哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.49,0:12:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我要做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.59,0:12:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,跟這傢伙一起做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.85,0:12:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,誰幹得下去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.27,0:12:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,別惹出什麼爭執  會給櫛枝添麻煩的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就自己做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.94,0:12:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,小個頭  送貨就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.24,0:12:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,送三箱啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,收到  非常樂意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.06,0:13:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.15,0:13:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好  這樣就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,要小心一點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.30,0:13:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,大河  怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.58,0:13:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,難道…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.77,0:13:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你不會騎自行車嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.55,0:13:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.88,0:13:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不會騎自行車又怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.75,0:13:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,只要把貨送到就好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.60,0:13:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,錯了  你錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.69,0:13:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,精力充沛啊  大河
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,太驚人了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,推著走的話  應該沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,對了  還要補充一下燒酒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:13:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:13:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我也來幫忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.35,0:14:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你看什麼都不做的話  果然還是不好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.67,0:14:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.41,0:14:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.94,0:14:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那個  番薯燒酒在…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,太暗了  都看不清
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.55,0:14:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,因為這裡不怎麼用到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,也就一個星期打開一次
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,被關起來的話  就麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,會有一種小遇難氣氛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那個小個頭  居然沒關門就走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.82,0:14:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,裡面還有人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,SOS  SOS
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.49,0:15:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,高須  冷靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.93,0:15:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,正是這種時候  才需要放聲高歌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.58,0:15:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,高歌?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.45,0:15:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,像個笨蛋一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.03,0:15:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,完全就不需要我這麼努力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.61,0:15:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,真的幹不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.83,0:15:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼幹不下去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.95,0:15:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,北…北村
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.27,0:15:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼  你會…會在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.48,0:15:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我在自主練習
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.63,0:16:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.12,0:16:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你會騎自行車啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,真是驚人的長進
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.03,0:16:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不  與其說會騎  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼你知道我不會騎自行車
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.73,0:16:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我去年非常留意你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.85,0:16:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,自行車真不錯  世界變得更加廣闊了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.40,0:16:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼逢坂再見  明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他去年對我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.35,0:17:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,北村不會注視我的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.99,0:17:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就算變得再寬闊也毫無意義
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.59,0:17:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,很晚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼弄成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.05,0:17:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.19,0:17:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,比起這個其他兩個人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.18,0:17:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,話說  櫛枝那傢伙跑去哪裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,龍兒就還好說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我在奮鬥的時候  那隻劣等狗竟敢悠閒地偷懶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.48,0:17:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,對了  接下來是3丁目…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.75,0:18:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,龍兒  你都在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊  接連未來的橋樑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是  御橋  御橋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,喉嚨乾透了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.77,0:18:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,唱那麼大聲居然沒人發現
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.29,0:18:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,這個時間  大叔正是沉迷賽馬中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.89,0:18:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.23,0:18:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有點冷了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.99,0:18:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不介意的話  就穿我的衣服…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,熱一下身子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.13,0:18:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,投手在害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.62,0:18:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,投手在害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.52,0:18:42.76,Comment,,0,0,0,,在害怕…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在害怕!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:44.70,Comment,,0,0,0,,投手不是櫛枝自己嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.35,0:18:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在害怕!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.23,0:18:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,投手在害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.88,0:18:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,投手在害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:52.48,Comment,,0,0,0,,難道…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:55.25,Comment,,0,0,0,,你真的在害怕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.76,0:18:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在害怕!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.87,0:18:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手在抖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭  這是振奮發抖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.77,0:19:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好球
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.85,0:19:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好  換人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.19,0:19:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,攻守互換
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.82,0:19:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,因為…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.33,0:19:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,即使害怕也沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.01,0:19:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,來把軟弱打飛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.33,0:19:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,或許她…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.83,0:19:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,或許…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那個  高須
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.93,0:19:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,可以從那裡出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.09,0:19:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪裡  在哪裡  在哪裡!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.43,0:19:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪裡  在哪裡  在哪裡!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪裡!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.99,0:19:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那裡  高須
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.65,0:19:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.74,0:19:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,或許櫛枝一直都那麼閃閃發亮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.79,0:20:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,並不只是因為她很開朗  很精神
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.69,0:20:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,危險…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.65,0:20:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.97,0:20:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒事…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.53,0:20:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,鼻血!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.73,0:20:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,總會有辦法的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.40,0:20:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,總會有辦法…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,鼻血是心靈的汗水
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,比起這個  還剩下一點點就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.02,0:20:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,快疊起來  高須
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.81,0:20:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊  把軟弱打飛…嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好  絕對要生還
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.51,0:20:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  那當然
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.92,0:20:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,說到Fight就要接…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.01,0:20:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,一…一發?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯沒錯  就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,一…一發!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.68,0:20:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.55,0:20:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,櫛枝從一開始就那麼閃閃發亮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.23,0:20:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,邂逅她的時候也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.23,0:20:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.80,0:20:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,現在也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一發!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,都在閃閃發亮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,找到你了!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.63,0:21:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,大河  你是怎麼進來的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.95,0:21:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼進來?  那當然是用梯子…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.39,0:21:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.22,0:21:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,高須  這樣我們就能出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.74,0:21:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你  大河
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.09,0:21:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,這才是真正的通往未來的梯子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.41,0:21:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那個  實乃梨…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  高須也快點起來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.29,0:21:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…所以聽我說!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.01,0:21:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,梯子剛才被我弄掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.43,0:23:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,靜靜塵封在心房的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.70,0:23:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不能向別人簡述  只屬於我們兩個人的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.23,0:23:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經跟高須說了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.41,0:23:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,北…北村!
